# A project saved before RvTone's knob spanned a longer range (sound revision 6) loads with the pot and its
# motion lane's steps divided by 1.3 (rounded), the same sound; the lane's empty steps stay empty, and the
# reverb's other pots and lanes are left as they were.
wait 300
param 4 0 5 57
lane 4 0 5 3 100
lane 4 0 5 5 127
lane 4 0 5 6 1
lane 4 0 5 7 0
param 4 0 4 100
lane 4 0 4 3 100
lane 4 0 7 3 90
sndrev 6
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect sound4.0.5 44
expect laneval4.0.5.3 77
expect laneval4.0.5.5 98
expect laneval4.0.5.4 255
expect laneval4.0.5.6 1
expect laneval4.0.5.7 0
expect sound4.0.4 100
expect laneval4.0.4.3 100
expect laneval4.0.7.3 90
# a project saved at the current revision keeps its values
param 4 0 5 120
lane 4 0 5 3 110
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect sound4.0.5 120
expect laneval4.0.5.3 110
# the ends of the pot: 127 (the old top) becomes 98, 0 stays 0
param 4 0 5 127
sndrev 6
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect sound4.0.5 98
param 4 0 5 0
sndrev 6
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect sound4.0.5 0
